  "details": "There is a canny asking to whitelist playable director and signal receivers in late 2020. Marked as complete.\n\nThere are more of them in 2021 saying they *don't* allow Udon interactions at all\n\nI've been using them for days making a complex animation with events firing with them, only to find out nothing works in VRChat.\n\nWhy was it marked as complete but doesnt work ? Was it removed ?\n\nWhy is it not available for world creators ?\n\nThis is way better of a method than any other solutions we need to deal with to achieve events synced with a playable timeline, which this issue rises as the only possibility despite the components being whitelisted.\n\nPlease allow world creators to fire UdonCustomEvents through the director, signal receiver and animation clips.\n\nI was going to make a free prefab that would allow people to easily make synced song animations and its lyrics in an optimized way, but the only solution i see now is an update loop and spam toggle objects with if statements, or other random solutions that feel like a hack rather than a proper way to do this when the components to do it are literally right there.\n\nPlease make this change to allow creators to make emotional animations with more ease.\n\nThis is extremely frustrating to have such a limitation suddenly appear in front of me for no reason.\n\nThank you.",
